              "description": "Process uploaded documents (PDFs, scans, LaTeX, structured/normative guidelines, etc.) from uploads/ into structured content objects. Handles OCR extraction, environment detection, structural analysis, and content-object generation. Supports multi-stage pipelines: raw upload → extracted text → structured blocks → .ts/.md content objects.",
              "hasIOContract": false,
              "hasInstructions": true,
              "inSubgraph": "https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/folio-assistant-core/folio-assistant-core.jsonld#directory/core-skills",
